WEBVTT

00:01:45.539 --> 00:01:51.876
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:05.153
It's been five years, Baki.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:08.371
Old man...!

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:14.459
"Killer Instinct”

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.436
"Old man"...?

00:02:20.841 --> 00:02:22.619
Hey, now...!

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:27.274
This is some pretty fun stuff
you're doing here, eh?

00:02:37.491 --> 00:02:39.769
He stopped Baki's punch...!

00:02:39.793 --> 00:02:42.005
Your fist is as slow as ever.

00:02:42.029 --> 00:02:45.397
| almost fell asleep waiting
for it to reach me.

00:03:01.915 --> 00:03:03.893
He knocked Baki out with one tap?!

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:07.820
Old man! I assume you know who I am?!

00:03:09.256 --> 00:03:13.970
Sign me up as an
underground fighter at once!

00:03:13.994 --> 00:03:15.689
The Ogre...!

00:03:21.802 --> 00:03:23.446
Orochi...!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.962
It's been 10 years...

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:34.891
How I've dreamed for this
ever since that day...

00:03:34.915 --> 00:03:39.284
| want to pay you back
for this scar and this scar!

00:03:54.668 --> 00:03:56.546
Doppo"s bleeding...!

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.282
It seems you've kept up your training...

00:03:59.306 --> 00:04:03.453
Half a step more and you
could've gouged my heart out.

00:04:03.477 --> 00:04:06.389
His punch made contact.

00:04:06.413 --> 00:04:08.224
Sir!

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:12.495
Am I still registered as a fighter here?

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:16.699
Worry not! I could
never remove your name!

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:21.471
Then could you make a match-up
of me versus that monster?

00:04:21.495 --> 00:04:26.524
You sure? You'll get much more
than a sliced face this time...

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:32.448
The Tiger Killer versus
the World's Strongest Being...!

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:36.170
They will fight in a special match!

00:04:41.882 --> 00:04:42.325
"Seiryu Locker Room"

00:04:42.349 --> 00:04:44.627
"Seiryu Locker Room"
| apologize, Baki-kun.

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:50.700
In my avarice, I pushed you,
the champion, to the side...

00:04:50.724 --> 00:04:52.702
You'll never win.

00:04:52.726 --> 00:04:56.439
His title as "strongest being
in the world" isn't a bluff.

00:04:56.463 --> 00:05:02.044
He could fight and
kill any beast on Earth.

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:08.084
But Baki-kun, it's well-known
that he's killed a tiger, too. Right?

00:05:08.108 --> 00:05:10.286
| apologize for going first.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.555
Just be sure you don't lose.

00:05:12.579 --> 00:05:13.956
You can't win!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:18.178
He's not strong just because
of his combat techniques.

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:26.135
My life shortens whenever
I'm around you, Yujiro.

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:27.703
Strydom.

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:29.991
Stop the car.

00:05:35.769 --> 00:05:38.204
Hold on, Yujiro...!

00:05:40.941 --> 00:05:43.911
What do you want at a boxing gym?

00:05:45.045 --> 00:05:47.390
Improving?

00:05:47.414 --> 00:05:48.291
Yeah.

00:05:48.315 --> 00:05:52.528
In terms of combat techniques,
he is always improving.

00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:57.433
He's no longer the guy you two knew.

00:05:57.457 --> 00:06:00.503
His fighting techniques
improve day by day,

00:06:00.527 --> 00:06:05.908
supported by his
unparalleled killer instincts.

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:11.647
Those instincts are the same as
a normal person"s hunger or libido...

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:15.130
He can't not kill anyone,
not even for one day...

00:06:16.977 --> 00:06:19.071
"Middleweight Champion- Tatsumi Yoichi”

00:06:19.412 --> 00:06:24.077
Here to watch? Then have
a seat on that sofa.

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:32.453
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:06:35.328 --> 00:06:36.489
Hey...!

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:52.178
Now nobody can escape...!

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:57.426
Mister...

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.496
Why're you trappin" a bunch of boxers?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.988
Knock it off.

00:07:04.324 --> 00:07:05.468
Champion...!

00:07:05.492 --> 00:07:08.018
I'll take you on, old man.

00:07:09.896 --> 00:07:13.491
| do love fighting more than boxing.

00:07:22.976 --> 00:07:25.721
Those are lovely punches.

00:07:25.745 --> 00:07:28.339
His punches aren't connecting...!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.315
Champ!

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:40.120
He'll keep killing
until he's satisfied...

00:07:42.829 --> 00:07:44.297
Baki-kun...

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:48.177
You may have conflicting emotions...

00:07:48.201 --> 00:07:52.638
...-but I will satisfy him,
much like a world-class chef.

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:57.905
Enough to give him food poisoning, even...

00:08:09.389 --> 00:08:16.038
Are you planning to do this every
night until your match with Orochi?

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:18.554
I'm gonna sleep well tonight...

00:08:29.309 --> 00:08:34.991
You're telling me, Orochi Doppo,
not to fight Hanma Yujiro?

00:08:35.015 --> 00:08:37.814
| don't want anyone to die needlessly.

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:42.621
Don't mock me, boy!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:48.904
Are you saying I cannot
beat Hanma Yujiro, kid?

00:08:48.928 --> 00:08:53.009
| don't mean only you.
Nobody would stand a chance.

00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:57.513
Just as I know there's nothing higher
on our Earth than the sky,

00:08:57.537 --> 00:09:00.583
| also know he's the strongest alive.

00:09:00.607 --> 00:09:05.855
| don't know how you see your old man,

00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:07.923
but come with me for a bit.

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:13.429
Today is the Shinshinkai's
infamous monthly free-for-all.

00:09:13.453 --> 00:09:19.358
Anyone, given they have the skill,
has the chance to clobber me.

00:09:23.997 --> 00:09:29.178
We must thank the gods that
we are pupils of the Shinshinkai.

00:09:29.202 --> 00:09:34.106
After all, it is our monthly chance
to be the world's strongest man.

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:37.909
After you.

00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:47.717
These men will attempt to be
the world's strongest today.

00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:55.656
Osu!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.794
Bow to the director...!

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:09.585
Today's a street fight.
Street fights don't have bowing.

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:12.655
Come at me, one after another.

00:10:12.679 --> 00:10:14.147
Osu!

00:10:21.054 --> 00:10:22.112
Osu!

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:24.582
Osu!

00:10:40.773 --> 00:10:44.801
--You're good...!
--Would you like to try?

00:10:45.678 --> 00:10:49.325
Since you're here, let's have a bout.

00:10:49.349 --> 00:10:54.879
That's unfair. Inviting me here
when you know I love to fight...

00:10:56.589 --> 00:10:58.467
You know I can't say no.

00:10:58.491 --> 00:11:02.004
Baki-kun. This is my dojo.

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:06.192
Even should you beat me,
you will not leave unharmed.

00:11:08.034 --> 00:11:11.095
He's only joking...!

00:11:13.373 --> 00:11:16.399
| guess you're not very nice either!

00:11:19.712 --> 00:11:22.158
How dare you...!

00:11:22.182 --> 00:11:26.495
Director! I'm sorry, but you should
forget about fighting my dad!

00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:32.151
If you fell for that surprise attack,
fighting him would be suicide!

00:11:38.731 --> 00:11:41.143
Well, then, let's begin...

00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:43.846
No way! That crotch hit didn't work?!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.549
It seems you know
very little about karate.

00:11:46.573 --> 00:11:51.954
Karate fighters have been hiding
their vital spots before fights for ages.

00:11:51.978 --> 00:11:53.722
"Hiding"...?!

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:58.741
Allow me to use this opportunity
to show you what true karate is...

00:12:11.197 --> 00:12:13.325
Let's begin.

00:12:16.002 --> 00:12:21.250
| will use an upper seiken strike.
Cover your face.

00:12:21.274 --> 00:12:23.538
Get ready, now...

00:12:25.178 --> 00:12:28.691
What's wrong, Baki-kun?
I told you I'd strike here.

00:12:28.715 --> 00:12:30.593
Fcan't move...!

00:12:30.617 --> 00:12:33.862
Next, I will give a
front kick to your midsection.

00:12:33.886 --> 00:12:35.631
Cover your solar plexus.

00:12:35.655 --> 00:12:37.555
Get ready, now...!

00:12:39.692 --> 00:12:42.004
And it connects.

00:12:42.028 --> 00:12:43.639
Shuto! Nukite!

00:12:43.663 --> 00:12:45.541
Uraken! Sokuto!

00:12:45.565 --> 00:12:47.795
Hold on...!

00:12:48.635 --> 00:12:54.574
I've done over 1000 of each of
those moves every day for 50 years.

00:12:55.508 --> 00:12:59.388
Anyone foolish enough to do
that can do what I just did.

00:12:59.412 --> 00:13:02.791
Even against the champion
of the underground arena...

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:08.230
That's incredible.
But he's beaten you before...

00:13:08.254 --> 00:13:10.313
What on earth happened?

00:13:22.001 --> 00:13:23.912
What do you want?

00:13:23.936 --> 00:13:28.484
When the match between you and
Orochi was decided, I was horrified

00:13:28.508 --> 00:13:32.454
that I would be unable to
pay you back for 8 years ago.

00:13:32.478 --> 00:13:35.491
Do you actually think you can beat me?

00:13:35.515 --> 00:13:39.577
| doubt any martial artist would
start a fight he could never win.

00:13:40.753 --> 00:13:43.732
This park is perfect.

00:13:43.756 --> 00:13:47.469
Afraid of fighting a
jujutsu expert on concrete?

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:51.430
| don't want anyone
interfering with my rare feast.

00:13:57.337 --> 00:13:58.600
Go ahead!

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.995
Ever since that day I lost to you,

00:14:13.019 --> 00:14:16.398
I devoted myself to
overcoming all attacks...

00:14:16.422 --> 00:14:20.290
And at long last, I did just that...!

00:14:22.362 --> 00:14:23.972
I can see them...!

00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:28.844
The attacks that I couldn't
even sense eight years ago...!

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:31.613
Well done, Motobe lzo.

00:14:31.637 --> 00:14:35.164
Allow me to reward you
for your hard work.

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:41.757
What's wrong?
Use any technique you want.

00:14:41.781 --> 00:14:44.927
This is the fist
that haunts your dreams!

00:14:44.951 --> 00:14:47.682
You fool...!

00:14:50.289 --> 00:14:51.450
What?!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:08.771
Lucky thing the ground wasn't concrete...

00:15:10.076 --> 00:15:14.890
You insist on knowing what
happened between me and Mr. Yujiro?

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:16.125
Yes.

00:15:16.149 --> 00:15:19.194
Why someone like you lost to him...

00:15:19.218 --> 00:15:21.230
Very well...

00:15:21.254 --> 00:15:24.733
| didn't actually lose to him in a match.

00:15:24.757 --> 00:15:26.919
It happened 10 years ago...

00:15:30.563 --> 00:15:34.743
--Wow, Doppo-chan!
--One bottle in one gulp...!

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:38.203
Congratulations on the completion
of your new main dojo, sir!

00:15:40.339 --> 00:15:42.818
Ok! Bring some more!

00:15:42.842 --> 00:15:44.753
You've had too much, sir!

00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:46.054
Quiet, you!

00:15:46.078 --> 00:15:50.025
--Can I have some too?
--Me too!

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:51.949
Orochi Doppo?

00:15:56.088 --> 00:15:57.487
Director!

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:07.509
This was the man said
to have God's fists?

00:16:07.533 --> 00:16:09.878
What a disappointment.

00:16:09.902 --> 00:16:12.047
The alcohol...

00:16:12.071 --> 00:16:15.017
It delayed my reaction
by a tenth of a second.

00:16:15.041 --> 00:16:17.986
But that's your own fault.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.656
A martial artist's life
is a constant match;

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:22.891
that's no excuse for losing.

00:16:22.915 --> 00:16:26.428
You're correct, Baki-kun.

00:16:26.452 --> 00:16:29.251
| feel regretful for him.

00:16:47.373 --> 00:16:50.486
| must satisfy him this time...

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:56.758
| waited two whole years for him,
as undefeated champion...

00:16:56.782 --> 00:17:00.685
Then suddenly you push me aside
and challenge him yourself.

00:17:06.893 --> 00:17:09.692
You'll pay dearly if you lose!

00:17:18.337 --> 00:17:20.328
Yujiro...!

00:17:26.145 --> 00:17:28.842
Baki-kun! Baki-kun!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.562
Are you going straight home today?

00:17:33.586 --> 00:17:36.556
--Why?
--Well, um-...

00:17:39.292 --> 00:17:40.885
Never mind...

00:17:46.699 --> 00:17:49.511
Yo, Champion. Been expectin' ya.

00:17:49.535 --> 00:17:50.846
Champion?

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:55.617
Let's do it! I've been
itchin' to fight ya!

00:17:55.641 --> 00:17:59.588
--Kozue-chan. Go on home.
--Let her stay.

00:17:59.612 --> 00:18:02.090
I1t'd be better to have someone watching

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:06.495
instead of going all the way
to the arena. Right?

00:18:06.519 --> 00:18:10.165
I think this guy's mistaken! Let's go!

00:18:10.189 --> 00:18:11.934
Mistaken...?!

00:18:11.958 --> 00:18:15.437
Wait, it's me! Kato!

00:18:15.461 --> 00:18:18.206
--We met in the locker room!
--Never seen you.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:23.445
Don't be like that, Champion!
| came all the way here for you!

00:18:23.469 --> 00:18:25.714
I have no idea who you are!

00:18:25.738 --> 00:18:28.884
And you call yourself the
strongest man underground?!

00:18:28.908 --> 00:18:30.672
Strongest man...?

00:18:32.578 --> 00:18:33.555
Yep.

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:39.227
He sure don't look it, but he's the
undefeated underground champion!

00:18:39.251 --> 00:18:43.198
Let's go, Kozue-chan!
Musashi must be starving!

00:18:43.222 --> 00:18:44.132
Wait...!

00:18:44.156 --> 00:18:49.404
Fine! Then you don't need
the old man's message!

00:18:49.428 --> 00:18:51.988
Damn kid...

00:18:58.971 --> 00:19:00.482
Mom.

00:19:00.506 --> 00:19:04.519
--This weird guy came to see Baki-kun today.
--And then?

00:19:04.543 --> 00:19:09.157
He called him "Champion™.
Isn't that strange?

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:12.427
| guess he mistook him
for a boxer or something...

00:19:12.451 --> 00:19:14.029
What did Baki-kun say?

00:19:14.053 --> 00:19:17.751
He didn't know him. But he
seemed to be hiding something.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:23.925
| was going to tell you someday,
but I guess now's the time.

00:19:26.132 --> 00:19:30.178
Your father was a real martial artist.

00:19:30.202 --> 00:19:32.547
He fought until he died.

00:19:32.571 --> 00:19:35.802
His goal in life was to be
the world's strongest man...

00:19:37.209 --> 00:19:41.390
Baki-kun lives in the same world he did.

00:19:41.414 --> 00:19:45.661
In a fairyland of men who determine
who the world's strongest is...

00:19:45.685 --> 00:19:47.062
Fairyland?

00:19:47.086 --> 00:19:53.402
Supposedly, all men want to be
the world's strongest at least once...

00:19:53.426 --> 00:19:56.138
So they fight and fight...

00:19:56.162 --> 00:20:00.575
| don't get it. Why would they do that?

00:20:00.599 --> 00:20:03.178
What's so big about
being the strongest?!

00:20:03.202 --> 00:20:05.147
I don't get it, either.

00:20:05.171 --> 00:20:11.319
But I thought it was wonderful
how he devoted everything to that...

00:20:11.343 --> 00:20:18.760
Why? He died because of that.
How can you call that wonderful?!

00:20:18.784 --> 00:20:22.831
And Baki-kun's the same way.
He gets all beat up...

00:20:22.855 --> 00:20:25.586
What's the point in it all...?

00:20:28.994 --> 00:20:31.190
I'll be back in the morning.

00:20:36.802 --> 00:20:40.515
Then you don't need
the old man's message!

00:20:40.539 --> 00:20:42.098
Message...?

00:20:45.444 --> 00:20:49.825
--And so you ran here?
--I'm sorry to intrude this late...

00:20:49.849 --> 00:20:54.062
I don't mind! I had wanted
to inform you, anyway!

00:20:54.086 --> 00:20:55.397
Tell me, Baki.

00:20:55.421 --> 00:20:58.767
Would you like to be the main event
the day Yujiro and Doppo fight?

00:20:58.791 --> 00:20:59.735
Eh?!

00:20:59.759 --> 00:21:04.239
| have an incredible opponent
worthy of the undefeated champion!

00:21:04.263 --> 00:21:08.131
So incredible that Yujiro
and Doppo might be shocked!

00:21:41.934 --> 00:21:43.879
Its neck was snapped.

00:21:43.903 --> 00:21:47.716
This is definitely the circus tiger
reported missing this morning.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.951
What's it doing here...?

00:21:49.975 --> 00:21:52.120
This was done barehanded.

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:55.375
Someone other than you can
beat a tiger barehanded?!

00:21:57.783 --> 00:22:00.218
"General Hospital”

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:02.664
Doctor!

00:22:02.688 --> 00:22:06.234
Where were you?!

00:22:06.258 --> 00:22:08.920
Out big-game hunting.

00:22:46.031 --> 00:22:51.580
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:51.604 --> 00:22:57.185
hangs onto love
in one corner of the pavement

00:22:57.209 --> 00:23:02.858
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:02.882 --> 00:23:07.863
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:07.887 --> 00:23:13.401
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:13.425 --> 00:23:18.940
gently enveloped in love

00:23:18.964 --> 00:23:24.613
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:24.637 --> 00:23:30.151
but they will be reborn

00:23:30.175 --> 00:23:35.824
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:35.848 --> 00:23:43.187
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:53.198
"Next Episode”

00:23:57.369 --> 00:23:58.947
Demon and war god.

00:23:58.971 --> 00:24:02.450
The festival of beasts
that all have waited for.

00:24:02.474 --> 00:24:05.921
The boy watches the banquet unfold.

00:24:05.945 --> 00:24:11.459
The two lofty, violent fangs
dance to prove their dominance.

00:24:11.483 --> 00:24:16.231
Who will survive the intense battle?
The demon or the war god?

00:24:16.255 --> 00:24:21.125
"Next Episode: The Two Titans Clash!"
